00:15:52.219 --> 00:15:55.791
render path as the web shell - it is URL

00:15:55.869 --> 00:15:58.767
mode under a different transport, so

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:03.244
--url=x is the value the app reads from ?

00:16:04.058 --> 00:16:06.743
url=x.

00:16:07.514 --> 00:16:10.215
That makes it the build-pipeline, CI and

00:16:10.276 --> 00:16:13.900
scripting surface: generate an OG card at

00:16:13.961 --> 00:16:18.688
build time, fan a CSV out into 400 badges,

00:16:18.755 --> 00:16:22.269
render-check the whole catalog as a gate.

00:16:23.050 --> 00:16:25.893
Code example omitted.

00:16:26.643 --> 00:16:28.853
Exports carry Content Credentials by

00:16:28.899 --> 00:16:31.238
default, signed on-device - for the

00:16:31.310 --> 00:16:34.036
formats that can hold a manifest «PNG,

00:16:34.094 --> 00:16:37.496
JPEG, WebP, AVIF, GIF, APNG, TIFF, SVG,

00:16:37.555 --> 00:16:42.106
PDF, MP4, WebM, MP3, M4A, WAV, OGG, Opus,

00:16:42.164 --> 00:16:46.753
FLAC, HTML, CSS, JS, MD»; EPS, EMF, DXF,

00:16:46.810 --> 00:16:50.927
PPTX, PSD, EXR, HDR, ICO, DOCX, ZIP and

00:16:50.957 --> 00:16:53.404
the plain-text formats have no container

00:16:53.487 --> 00:16:54.878
for one, and

00:16:55.825 --> 00:16:59.343
on-device utilities never stamp.

00:17:00.116 --> 00:17:03.603
To sign as you - so a recipient who pins

00:17:03.666 --> 00:17:06.454
your root reads Verified with your address

00:17:06.545 --> 00:17:09.282
on it rather than an anonymous signer -

00:17:09.343 --> 00:17:12.211
point it at your own key and certificate

00:17:12.271 --> 00:17:13.370
chain:

