00:18:30.116 --> 00:18:33.207
Where your changes go - almost everywhere,

00:18:33.267 --> 00:18:36.594
a change is one commit in this repo.

00:18:37.370 --> 00:18:41.582
The one exception is brands/suse: a change

00:18:41.643 --> 00:18:44.491
