00:19:10.679 --> 00:19:12.293
Deploying.

00:19:13.094 --> 00:19:15.426
lolly-tools and lolly-ing use

00:19:15.527 --> 00:19:19.594
operator-managed UpCloud K3s releases.

00:19:20.368 --> 00:19:23.217
Use the sovereign deployment profile and

00:19:23.266 --> 00:19:26.545
the instance's current deployment handoff.

00:19:27.295 --> 00:19:30.830
pnpm run gate still checks the release;

00:19:30.912 --> 00:19:34.128
scripts/ship-ts refuses these managed

00:19:34.188 --> 00:19:37.170
targets before building or uploading.

00:19:37.945 --> 00:19:41.737
Explicit Vercel and internal IT adapters

00:19:41.842 --> 00:19:44.805
